  "description": "Ordinary office worker 'Ji-ho' is lethargic, and dating with girlfriend 'Solbin' feels boring..  \nAt that time, he became acquainted with the ‘new’ YouTuber ‘Eunyul’, who had novelty and excitement.  \nHis emotions explode like fireworks.  \n\"I can't do this... I can't..\" But his heart keeps going that way...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=786189), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6867134)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002803)",
